<title>USA: Kitsap County, Wash., yields 4.85 pct in 2004.</title>
<headline>Kitsap County, Wash., yields 4.85 pct in 2004.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth Inc said it priced $5.210 million of Kitsap County, Wash., limited tax general obligation refunding bonds, with a top yield of 4.85 percent in 2004.</p>
